# weather emotes store snapshot
# weather tables: 9   seasonal-ambience tables: 6
# dimensions: type x section x biome x band x season, then (track,season) ambience.
# Single role (the room is told), no tokens authored anywhere in this store.
# A fresh SequencePicker per row pins index 0.
# An empty row ("") in a mild band is deliberate silence, not a missing pool.

